- **URL:** 
https://www.academia.edu/43416584/_2020_A_G_Vlachopoulos_The_Ring_of_Nestor_and_
the_quest_for_authenticity_in_F_Blakolmer_ed_Current_Approaches_and_New_Perspect
ives_in_Aegean_Iconography_Aegis_18_2020_pp_223_252  
- **Publisher/Institution (original):** Aegis (series), Liège; the Academia.edu 
page is an upload of the chapter.  
- **Author:** Andreas G. Vlachopoulos.  
- **Date:** 2020.  
- **Source type:** Peer‑reviewed book chapter in an academic volume; the 
